title: "rotcert: distribution-free per-class localization and recall certificates for oriented object detectors"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-16"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21392293"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PeterPonyu/rotcert"
